<title>POLAND: KRAKCHEMIA APRIL NET UP TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>KRAKCHEMIA APRIL NET UP TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.24 vs   0.10</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.36 vs   0.10</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.54 vs   0.37</p>
<p> Sales		   11.79 vs  10.46</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.56 vs   0.20 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.87 vs   0.20 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.61 vs   0.75</p>
<p> Sales		   42.63 vs  36.91</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish trading company is Krakchemia</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
